+## Unreleased
+
+- A control word, control symbol or binary run after `\uN` consumes one fallback character.
+- `\plain` restores the document's default font. Font-table `\cpgN` overrides `\fcharsetN`.
+- The default feature set decodes KOI8-R, KOI8-U and ISO-8859 code pages for raw bytes and hex escapes.
+  Unknown code pages use Windows-1252.
+
 ## [0.6.0] - 2026-10-21
 
